*      TRIDIAGONALIZATION HAS BEEN COMPLETED.                           MLEW 311
*      THE NEW DIAGONAL OCCUPIES THE DIAGONAL IN A.                     MLEW 312
*      THE OFF DIAGONAL OCCUPIES EXTRA(.,4).                            MLEW 313
*      EACH ROW OF THE UPPER TRIANGLE OF A CONTAINS                     MLEW 314
*      INFORMATION ABOUT ONE OF THE N-1 ORTHOGONAL                      MLEW 315
*      SIMILARITY TRANSFORMATIONS USED.                                 MLEW 316
*      THE LOWER TRIANGLE OF A HAS NOT YET BEEN TOUCHED.                MLEW 317
*              BOUND=ABSF(A(1,1))+ABSF(EXTRA(1,4))                      MLEW 318
*              DO 18 I4=2,N                                             MLEW 319
*              ABOUND=ABSF(A(I4,I4))+ABSF(EXTRA(I4,4))+ABSF(EXTRA(I4-1,4MLEW 320
*      18      BOUND=MAX1F(BOUND,ABOUND)                                MLEW 321
*              EXTRA(N,4)=0.                                            MLEW 322
       TSX     BDWAY,4                                                  MLEW 323
